    "share_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ramp_introducing-routercom-built-for-ctos-loved-activity-7495913735715426304-9cb6",
    "text": "Introducing Router.com. Built for CTOs. Loved by CFOs.\n\nPeople in those two roles rarely want the same thing. \n\nEngineering wants the best model for every workload, and the best model changes almost every week. \n\nFinance wants the AI bill to stop endlessly climbing. \n\nUsually you’re forced to pick a side. Ramp Router is built so you don't have to. \n\nOne endpoint sends every request to the model that's genuinely best for the job - frontier when the work needs it, leaner when it doesn't. Engineering gets the right model for every workload. Finance gets lower inference spend and higher ROI. \n\nEverybody wins.\n\nWe've run Ramp's own AI on it for 3 years and cut our costs ~30% for the same output. Today it's open to everyone: router.com - two lines of code, free through 2026 for everyone to get started."
